.40] The immigration situation in other countries.--[v.41] Statements and recommendations submitted by societies and organizations interested in the subject of immigration</dd>\n<dd>conv lwr</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects: Emigration and immigration; Emigration and immigration law -- United States; Industries -- United States; United States -- Emigration and immigration</div>",
